  translation {
    text: "Bus shuttles will be replacing the A Line Saturday, July 25 between Denver Airport and 40th and Airport-Gateway Park Stations between 3:00AM and 3:00PM.\r\n\nBus shuttle boarding locations are as follows:  \r\nDenver Airport Station: Arrivals at Gate 6; Departures at Gate 7 \r\n61st-Pena Station: In front of the station \r\n40th & Airport-Gateway Park Station: Gate A"
